%SIXMD 1
# @?KCC - NATIVE PDP-10 C COMPILER DRIVER

## DESCRIPTION

KCC IS THE NATIVE C COMPILER DRIVER INSTALLED WITH THE OPTIONAL
DAIMOS DEVELOPMENT TOOLS. THE CURRENT BOOT IMAGE CONTAINS A
PREBUILT DRIVER AND FOUR PRIVATE COMPILER PHASES. THE DRIVER
COORDINATES PREPROCESSING, PARSING, CODE GENERATION, AND OPTIMIZATION.

THE PHASE EXECUTABLES KCPP, KPARSE, KGEN, AND KOPT ARE INTERNAL
IMPLEMENTATION COMPONENTS, NOT SEPARATE USER COMMANDS. THEIR
EXECUTION AND FILE FORMAT CONTRACTS ARE CONTROLLED BY THE DRIVER.

SOURCE FILES AND A PLATFORM MAKEFILE ARE STAGED BELOW
/OPTION/SOURCE/KCC. A COMPLETE SELF-HOSTED NATIVE REBUILD OF KCC
HAS NOT BEEN ACCEPTED; THE PRESENCE OF THE BOOTSTRAP EXECUTABLES
DOES NOT CLAIM FULL SELF-HOSTING SUPPORT.

## @?FILES

### @?/OPTION/BASE/EXEC/KCC
THE INSTALLED NATIVE COMPILER DRIVER.

### @?/OPTION/BASE/LIBEXEC/KCC
THE PRIVATE COMPILER PHASE EXECUTABLES.

### @?/OPTION/SOURCE/KCC
STAGED COMPILER SOURCES, PLATFORM FILES, AND BOOTSTRAP OBJECTS.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - COMPILATION COMPLETED
### @?1 - COMPILATION FAILED
